349
00:13:31,849 --> 00:13:32,911
Simpen amunisimu

350
00:13:33,061 --> 00:13:33,403
Inggih.

351
00:13:34,795 --> 00:13:36,385
Coba aja nembak jaran-jaran kuwi.

352
00:13:36,535 --> 00:13:38,899
Telung tembung sing paling penting nalika perang diwiwiti

353
00:13:39,049 --> 00:13:39,461
