Kurangi omong kosongmu!

392
00:15:18,297 --> 00:15:19,189
Kuwi jelas aku.

393
00:15:19,339 --> 00:15:19,751
Meneng waé.

394
00:15:19,901 --> 00:15:21,377
Ana siji manèh ing sisih kiwa.

395
00:15:21,901 --> 00:15:22,133
Ah!

396
00:15:23,501 --> 00:15:24,303
