421
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:24,471
Inggih, inggih.

422
00:16:25,745 --> 00:16:26,875
Mandheg ngadeg-ngadeg waé.

423
00:16:27,025 --> 00:16:28,177
Nggawa wong urip dhisik.

424
