437
00:16:49,899 --> 00:16:51,995
menyang Omah Kulawarga Xu lan godhog banyu

438
00:16:52,145 --> 00:16:53,227
kanggo nggawé sup panas.

439
00:16:53,377 --> 00:16:54,419
Kepala Desa Zhou

440
00:16:54,569 --> 00:16:55,211
Ora perlu.

441
00:16:55,369 --> 00:16:58,165
Mangga, panjenengan kedah nampi tandha panuwun kula menika.

442
00:16:58,315 --> 00:17:01,367
Yen panjenengan ora nglilani kita nuduhake rasa matur nuwun sanget,

443
