Ayo tindakake kaya sing diomongake Kepala Desa Zhou.

446
00:17:07,821 --> 00:17:10,781
Njupuk ambegan sedhéla, ngumbah rai, lan ngatur ambegan.

447
00:17:10,931 --> 00:17:12,469
Kowé meh ora isa ngadeg kaya ngéné.

448
00:17:12,619 --> 00:17:14,335
