Panasake banyu kanggo Lin lan liyane.

452
00:17:19,285 --> 00:17:21,331
Aku péngin tetep lan nulungi Sedulur Chen Su.

453
00:17:22,185 --> 00:17:23,661
Wanita enom sing hebat tenan!

454
00:17:23,985 --> 00:17:24,427
