479
00:18:05,927 --> 00:18:08,387
Golekana saben wong sing bisa ngadeg ing sisih tengen

480
00:18:08,537 --> 00:18:11,131
Lebokna bocah-bocah lan wong wadon sing tatu ing mburi.

481
00:18:11,281 --> 00:18:12,353
