Pistol kasebut nembak 38 butir.

593
00:21:48,458 --> 00:21:50,798
Senapan mesin ringan kuwi nembak sangang butir peluru.

594
00:21:50,948 --> 00:21:52,294
Patang puluh pitu babak kabèh.

595
00:21:52,715 --> 00:21:55,185
Nalika kavaleri Xia Kulon nyerang formasi kita

596
