634
00:23:11,091 --> 00:23:14,191
Banjur teka para pengungsi, paceklik, lan tenaga kerja corvée.

635
00:23:14,341 --> 00:23:15,591
Yen kita péngin urip ing kéné

636
00:23:15,741 --> 00:23:17,905
Ngerti carane berjuang dhewekan ora bakal cukup.

637
00:23:18,055 --> 00:23:21,033
Kita ora bisa manèh ngandelake bedhil minangka senjata standar.

638
00:23:21,183 --> 00:23:22,613
Yen pancen péngin urip ing kéné

639
