sawise dokumen-dokumen wis beres,

948
00:33:40,343 --> 00:33:43,747
kita bakal mutusaké apa arep ngirim wong-wong kita dhèwèké saka desa kasebut

949
00:33:43,897 --> 00:33:45,887
utawa golèk sambungan sing bisa dipercaya

950
00:33:46,037 --> 00:33:48,627
ngeterake menyang Qinzhou lan ngedol menyang panguwasa

951
00:33:48,777 --> 00:33:50,987
Yen ngono ayo terusake rencana kuwi saiki.

952
00:33:51,137 --> 00:33:53,731
Simpenen limang jaran paling apik kanggo keperluan desa dhèwèké.

953
00:33:53,881 --> 00:33:56,081
Liyane, ngenteni nganti Kantor Kabupaten

954
00:33:56,231 --> 00:33:58,533
ngrampungake dokumen sadurungé kita mindhahake.

955
00:33:58,683 --> 00:33:59,195
Rampung.

956
00:33:59,345 --> 00:34:00,733
Wong tuwa kuwi bakal ngatur

957
00:34:00,883 --> 00:34:02,771
saluran resmi sing tepat kanggo dituruti.

958
00:34:05,017 --> 00:34:05,989
Demamé wis mudhun.

959
00:34:07,517 --> 00:34:09,453
Dhik Chen, koyone demamne wis mudhun.

960
00:34:13,050 --> 00:34:13,712
Nyonya Chen

961
00:34:14,017 --> 00:34:15,329
Apa wong lanangku wis teka?

962
00:34:16,083 --> 00:34:17,055
Demamé wis mudhun.

963
00:34:17,205 --> 00:34:19,227
Dheweke kuduné wis ora ana bebaya saiki.

964
00:34:19,377 --> 00:34:20,527
Ah. Ah.

965
00:34:20,677 --> 00:34:23,363
Terusna ngopeni dhèwèké kaya sing wis tak wulangke sadurungé.

966
00:34:23,513 --> 00:34:24,797
Lakoni kanthi caramu dhèwèké.

967
00:34:24,947 --> 00:34:27,531
Terusna banyu mili, lan aja nganti ana sing lunga.

968
00:34:27,681 --> 00:34:27,983
Hmmm. ...

969
00:34:28,247 --> 00:34:29,463
Hei, aku kelingan.

970
00:34:29,613 --> 00:34:30,545
Aku kelingan kabèh.

971
