972
00:34:31,638 --> 00:34:34,036
Hei, kepala omah tangga, aku ana ing kéné.

973
00:34:34,904 --> 00:34:36,590
Wenèhana dhèwèké banyu manèh sore iki.

974
00:34:36,740 --> 00:34:38,398
Coba wenehi bubur encer mengko.

975
00:34:42,740 --> 00:34:43,574
Apa iki tenan?

976
00:34:44,540 --> 00:34:45,362
