Apa kabar?

978
00:34:46,324 --> 00:34:48,644
Aku ora bakal ndemek barang-barang bekas iki apa waé.

979
00:34:48,794 --> 00:34:49,990
Lembut banget pisau iki

980
00:34:50,228 --> 00:34:52,250
Sawetara owah-owahan nyata ing perang

981
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:54,380
Lan meh mesthi bakal mlengkung metu saka bentuk

982
00:34:54,530 --> 00:34:55,698
Dheweke mung katon pas.

983
00:34:55,848 --> 00:34:57,920
Nalika kita kudu berjuang kanggo urip kita,

984
