iki bakal apik apa ora?

985
00:35:00,170 --> 00:35:01,082
Lan iki uga.

986
00:35:01,232 --> 00:35:02,338
Iku kudu dilakoni.

987
00:35:02,932 --> 00:35:04,328
Yen ana perang nyata sing pecah,

988
00:35:04,478 --> 00:35:05,876
