989
00:35:06,026 --> 00:35:07,594
Kakang Ma, mripatmu tajem.

990
00:35:07,744 --> 00:35:10,194
Nanging apa kowé ora bisa landhep semono sepisan waé?

991
00:35:10,344 --> 00:35:11,236
Iki Dinasti Song.

992
00:35:11,386 --> 00:35:12,742
Sewu taun kepungkur, Cak.

993
00:35:12,892 --> 00:35:14,530
Kowé ora bakal ana ing donya iki

994
00:35:15,392 --> 00:35:16,496
kanggo sewu taun manèh.

995
00:35:17,392 --> 00:35:18,354
Kowé isa ngowahi.

996
00:35:18,826 --> 00:35:19,818
Mesthi waé aku isa.

997
00:35:19,968 --> 00:35:22,094
Ing jangka panjang, kita kudu mbangun tungku,

998
00:35:22,244 --> 00:35:24,844
modifikasi bellow, lan golèk batu bara sing luwih apik

999
00:35:24,994 --> 00:35:26,816
supaya kita bisa ngasilake baja.

1000
00:35:26,966 --> 00:35:28,428
Pedhang, tombak, lan tombak...

1001
00:35:28,578 --> 00:35:29,692
Desain iku siji bab.

1002
00:35:29,842 --> 00:35:31,500
Materi iku sejatine sing penting.

1003
00:35:31,650 --> 00:35:34,020
Yen wesi ora apik, kabèh sing kokgawe bakal rusak.

1004
00:35:34,170 --> 00:35:35,930
Nanging kuwi critane kanggo dina liya.

1005
00:35:36,080 --> 00:35:37,102
Ora perlu kesusu.

1006
00:35:37,252 --> 00:35:38,718
Yen sampeyan péngin asil sing cepet

1007
00:35:38,868 --> 00:35:40,514
miwiti nganggo gandhewa lan panah

1008
00:35:40,664 --> 00:35:42,102
Kepriyé carane nindakake kuwi?

1009
00:35:42,764 --> 00:35:44,940
Ana akeh perkara sing bisa kita tingkatake.

1010
00:35:45,090 --> 00:35:47,420
Mata panah, gagang panah, lan panah lembing.

1011
00:35:47,570 --> 00:35:49,362
Isih akeh sing bisa kita tingkatake.

1012
00:35:49,512 --> 00:35:51,708
Malah wujude gandhewa uga bisa diatur.

1013
00:35:51,858 --> 00:35:53,222
Kita wis duwe bahan sing cukup.

1014
00:35:53,372 --> 00:35:54,856
Nggawe batch sing ngluwihi iki

1015
00:35:55,006 --> 00:35:56,884
kanthi wates sing amba ora bakal angel.

1016
00:35:57,340 --> 00:35:59,484
Barang-barang sing digawe wong-wong iki kasar banget.

1017
00:35:59,634 --> 00:36:00,974
Elinga iki kanggo saiki.

1018
00:36:01,124 --> 00:36:02,364
Desane nembe waé mapan.

1019
00:36:02,514 --> 00:36:04,226
Kita durung perlu tumindak apa-apa.

1020
00:36:04,376 --> 00:36:07,442
Sawise omah, tenaga kerja, lan kayu wis diurutake kabèh

1021
00:36:07,592 --> 00:36:09,706
Banjur kita bisa nggawé rencana sing luwih rinci.

1022
00:36:09,856 --> 00:36:10,588
Ora kesusu.

1023
00:36:15,356 --> 00:36:16,750
Kepala Desa wonten mriki.

1024
00:36:16,989 --> 00:36:19,213
Kudune kita wis ngrampungake masalah bengi iki

1025
00:36:19,363 --> 00:36:20,517
penginapan jaman biyen.

1026
00:36:20,667 --> 00:36:22,603
Kahanané wis rada rame akhir-akhir iki

1027
00:36:22,753 --> 00:36:23,775
