1028
00:36:24,753 --> 00:36:26,487
Kepala Desa Zhou, mangga lenggah.

1029
00:36:26,637 --> 00:36:28,107
Ayo padha ngrembug bab mangan.

1030
00:36:28,257 --> 00:36:30,045
Ora, ora, aku ora apa-apa.

1031
00:36:30,195 --> 00:36:32,663
Ayo padha ngadhepi apa sing ana ing ngarep kita dhisik.

1032
00:36:32,813 --> 00:36:34,893
Kowé kabèh butuh panggonan kanggo nginep bengi iki

1033
00:36:35,043 --> 00:36:36,911
Saben uwong butuh panggonan kanggo turu

1034
00:36:37,061 --> 00:36:40,341
Kita bisa ngrampungake liyane sajrone sawetara dina sabanjure.

1035
00:36:40,491 --> 00:36:42,011
Tuan Muda Lin lan Nyonya Chen

1036
00:36:42,161 --> 00:36:44,137
bakal nginep ing omahe Sanhuai bengi iki.

1037
00:36:44,287 --> 00:36:46,641
Tuan Muda Lin bakal tetep ana ing kamar utama.

1038
00:36:46,791 --> 00:36:49,005
Lady Chen bakal mbagi sayap wétan karo Qinghe.

1039
00:36:49,155 --> 00:36:50,957
Kita bakal nglakoni sawetara dina.

1040
00:36:51,107 --> 00:36:53,073
Sawise kamar-kamar ing mburi diresiki

1041
00:36:53,223 --> 00:36:54,881
kita bakal nggawé pengaturan liyane.

1042
00:36:55,031 --> 00:36:56,937
Mesthi waé, kuwi ora bakal dadi masalah.

1043
00:36:57,087 --> 00:36:57,909
Sedulurku Ma

1044
00:36:58,059 --> 00:36:58,811
Sedulur Wang

1045
00:36:58,961 --> 00:37:00,171
Aku wis ngatur kanggo kowé.

1046
00:37:00,321 --> 00:37:02,665
Kulawarga-kulawarga sugih ing rong desa kasebut

1047
00:37:02,815 --> 00:37:04,493
duwe kamar kosong ing omahe dhèwèk-dhèwèk

1048
00:37:04,643 --> 00:37:06,401
Ayo padha nginep karo dhèwèké bengi iki

1049
00:37:06,551 --> 00:37:09,367
Kowé ora perlu kuwatir babagan pangan utawa papan panggonan.

1050
00:37:09,517 --> 00:37:12,657
Apa kowé ora lagi ngomong nèk ana sing arep diomongké marang Kakang Xie?

1051
00:37:12,807 --> 00:37:14,897
Apa ana sing péngin kok omongaké karo Kakang Xie?

1052
00:37:15,940 --> 00:37:16,952
Ah, karo aku?

1053
00:37:17,307 --> 00:37:18,179
