1054
00:37:18,329 --> 00:37:18,811
Wis surup.

1055
00:37:19,129 --> 00:37:20,489
Yen sampeyan ora keberatan

1056
00:37:20,639 --> 00:37:23,281
panjenengan saged nginep wonten ing griya kula sakmenika.

1057
00:37:23,431 --> 00:37:24,565
Kamar cadangan wis siap.

1058
00:37:24,765 --> 00:37:27,363
Kita uga bisa langsung nyiyapake sprei kanggo sampeyan.

1059
00:37:27,513 --> 00:37:28,155
Ora perlu.

1060
00:37:28,305 --> 00:37:29,877
Aku isa melu karo Insinyur Ma.

1061
00:37:30,027 --> 00:37:31,079
Mandheg ngrubung aku.

1062
00:37:31,229 --> 00:37:32,545
Rungokna dhisik omongane.

1063
00:37:33,329 --> 00:37:34,201
Tuan Muda Xie

1064
00:37:34,351 --> 00:37:36,037
Kowé wis nylametaké nyawané Qiao Niang.

1065
00:37:36,187 --> 00:37:38,497
Sakabèhé kulawargaku bakal tansah ngéling-éling iki.

1066
00:37:38,647 --> 00:37:39,669
Yen dudu kanggo kowé

1067
00:37:39,819 --> 00:37:41,105
dhèwèké ora bakal ana ing kéné

1068
00:37:41,255 --> 00:37:42,993
dhèwèké ora bakal ana ing kéné dina iki.

1069
00:37:43,143 --> 00:37:44,613
Aku kebetulan nylametake dhèwèké.

1070
00:37:44,763 --> 00:37:46,579
Aku mesthi bakal nylametake sapa waé.

1071
