Ora ana apa-apa.

1072
00:37:47,861 --> 00:37:50,129
Bisa uga ora ana apa-apane kanggo sampeyan

1073
00:37:50,279 --> 00:37:51,803
nanging kanggo kulawarga kita

1074
00:37:51,953 --> 00:37:52,395
iku kabèh

1075
00:37:52,920 --> 00:37:53,812
Kita wong desa

1076
00:37:53,962 --> 00:37:55,698
Kita ora ngerti titik-titik penting urip.

1077
00:37:55,848 --> 00:37:57,900
Kita mung ngerti yen sampeyan sing nylametake dhèwèké.

1078
00:37:58,050 --> 00:37:58,922
Tuan Muda Xie

1079
00:37:59,072 --> 00:38:00,198
Yen kowé ora protes,

1080
00:38:00,348 --> 00:38:02,888
kita kepéngin masrahaké masa depané Qiao Niang marang kowé.

1081
00:38:03,038 --> 00:38:05,126
