1082
00:38:05,276 --> 00:38:07,366
A-apa maksudmu, masrahaké dhèwèké marang aku?

1083
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:11,016
Aku lan kanca-kanca ora bakal wani ngimpi dadi bojo sahmu.

1084
00:38:11,166 --> 00:38:14,044
Kita ora mungkin bisa duwe cita-cita sing dhuwur kaya ngono.

1085
00:38:14,194 --> 00:38:16,692
Yen Tuan Muda Xie gelem njaga dhèwèké ing sisihane

1086
00:38:16,842 --> 00:38:19,130
sanajan dhèwèké mung ngurus kabutuhan saben dinamu

1087
00:38:19,280 --> 00:38:20,386
kita bakal nampa kuwi

1088
00:38:20,536 --> 00:38:23,916
Aku ora nylametake dhèwèké. Aku mung nulungi wong sing butuh.

1089
00:38:24,066 --> 00:38:24,918
Ora kanggo kuwi.

1090
00:38:25,068 --> 00:38:27,076
Kita ngerti Tuan Muda Xie iku wong sing apik.

1091
00:38:27,226 --> 00:38:28,558
Nanging prinsipé tetep padha.

1092
00:38:28,708 --> 00:38:30,404
Kita wis ngubungi Kepala Desa mau.

1093
00:38:30,708 --> 00:38:33,278
Kepala Desa ngendika yen iku ora metu saka jalur.

1094
00:38:33,428 --> 00:38:35,470
Banjur aku bakal dadi wong lanang sing kaya apa?

1095
00:38:35,620 --> 00:38:37,446
Kepiye carane aku bisa nindakake kuwi?

1096
00:38:37,596 --> 00:38:39,364
Tuan Muda Xie, ora perlu iki.

1097
00:38:39,529 --> 00:38:40,581
Kowé wis mapan ing kéné.

1098
00:38:41,529 --> 00:38:43,979
Ora bakal rugi yen ana wong liya sing njaga awakmu.

1099
00:38:44,129 --> 00:38:45,537
Ora ana sing salah karo kuwi.

1100
00:38:45,687 --> 00:38:46,845
A-aku ora maksud kowé.

1101
00:38:47,053 --> 00:38:49,267
Aku mung ngomong yen ana sing ora beres karo iki.

1102
00:38:49,417 --> 00:38:50,853
Dudu kuwi sing tak karepake.

1103
00:38:51,651 --> 00:38:52,871
Nginep sewengi waé saiki.

1104
00:38:53,084 --> 00:38:54,636
Kita bisa ngrembug liyane mengko.

1105
00:38:55,717 --> 00:38:56,189
Ngerti.

1106
00:38:59,117 --> 00:39:00,343
Bengi iki ya bengi iki.

1107
00:39:00,493 --> 00:39:02,613
Nggoleki panggonan kanggo mapan iku luwih dhisik.

1108
00:39:02,763 --> 00:39:03,755
Kanggo mapan mengko...

1109
00:39:04,097 --> 00:39:07,065
Ana telung kulawarga ing desa iki sing ora duwe ahli waris.

1110
00:39:07,215 --> 00:39:09,387
Aku wis duwe sawetara ide ing pikiranku.

1111
00:39:09,537 --> 00:39:11,179
Kita bisa merenovasi dadi omah.

1112
00:39:11,329 --> 00:39:12,671
Yen kowé papat pancèn niyat arep

1113
00:39:12,821 --> 00:39:13,989
manggon ing Desa Qinghe,

1114
00:39:14,139 --> 00:39:17,247
kowé ora bisa terus pindhah saka panggonan siji menyang panggonan liyane

1115
00:39:17,397 --> 00:39:19,113
lan tetep ing ngendi waé sampeyan bisa.

1116
00:39:19,263 --> 00:39:20,533
Tuan Muda Lin, kowé papat

1117
00:39:20,683 --> 00:39:23,263
bisa nyawisake plataran sing luwih amba kanggo sampeyan.

1118
00:39:23,413 --> 00:39:25,815
Kita bisa merenovasi sithik mbaka sithik mengko.

1119
00:39:25,965 --> 00:39:27,433
Telung kamar utama kuduné cukup.

1120
00:39:27,583 --> 00:39:29,889
Kamar-kamar sisih uga kuduné cukup kanggo kabèh wong.

1121
00:39:30,039 --> 00:39:31,179
Dene kanggo Nyonya Chen,

1122
00:39:31,329 --> 00:39:32,497
kita bakal nyisihake

1123
00:39:32,647 --> 00:39:34,315
plataran kapisah kanggo dhèwèké mengko.

1124
00:39:34,465 --> 00:39:35,855
Yagéné dhèwèké entuk panggonane dhèwèk?

1125
00:39:36,005 --> 00:39:37,813
Kepiye carane wanita enom kuwi bisa

1126
00:39:37,963 --> 00:39:39,731
mbagi omah karo saklompok wong lanang?

1127
00:39:39,881 --> 00:39:42,729
Banjur apa kowé isa mbangunake rumah sakit kanggo aku uga?

1128
00:39:42,879 --> 00:39:43,681
Panggonan apa?

1129
00:39:43,831 --> 00:39:46,191
Panggonan khusus kanggo nambani wong lara lan tatu

1130
00:39:46,341 --> 00:39:47,353
Lan ngrawat pasien

1131
00:39:47,503 --> 00:39:49,299
Luwih becik yen mbangun omah rong lantai.

1132
00:39:49,449 --> 00:39:52,735
Lantai ndhuwur bakal nyimpen jamu lan nyedhiyakake papan kanggo manggon.

1133
00:39:52,885 --> 00:39:54,677
Kita bisa nambani pasien ing ngisor.

1134
00:39:54,827 --> 00:39:56,293
Oh, putriku sing isih enom!

1135
00:39:56,443 --> 00:39:57,425
Kuwi ora bakal cukup.

1136
00:39:57,575 --> 00:39:59,895
Kepiye carane omah tapel wates bisa mbangun menara?

1137
00:40:00,108 --> 00:40:01,652
Kuwi nglanggar peraturan bangunan.

1138
00:40:01,802 --> 00:40:02,866
Maksudmu iki klinik,

1139
00:40:03,135 --> 00:40:03,517
