1140
00:40:04,435 --> 00:40:05,337
Klinik iku klinik.

1141
00:40:05,487 --> 00:40:07,439
Banjur wenehake panggonan kanggo aku dhèwèké.

1142
00:40:07,589 --> 00:40:08,899
Plataran amba uga cukup.

1143
00:40:09,049 --> 00:40:10,213
Hei, iki berhasil.

1144
00:40:10,416 --> 00:40:13,452
Kita isa ndandani omah utama lan kamar sisih sakbanjure.

1145
00:40:13,602 --> 00:40:15,318
Aku bakal ngrampungi kabèh kanggo kowé.

1146
00:40:15,468 --> 00:40:16,896
Sugeng ngaso, sedaya.

1147
00:40:17,046 --> 00:40:21,008
Aku isih duwe urusan sing kudu diurus. Aku arep lunga saiki.

1148
00:40:26,646 --> 00:40:28,962
Muga-muga Bodhisattva Guanyin nglindhungi kita.

1149
00:40:29,112 --> 00:40:31,562
Apa maksudmu, "Bodhisattva Guanyin mberkahi kita"?

1150
00:40:31,712 --> 00:40:34,416
Yen kowé takon aku, Lady Chen kuwi bisa uga mung

1151
00:40:34,566 --> 00:40:36,224
minangka penjelmaan saka Guanyin.

1152
00:40:36,666 --> 00:40:37,702
Nganggo klambi putih kabèh

1153
00:40:37,852 --> 00:40:39,148
Dhèwèké wis nylametaké akèh wong.

1154
00:40:39,298 --> 00:40:40,966
Yen dudu Guanyin, banjur sapa dhèwèké?

1155
00:40:41,116 --> 00:40:42,528
Guanyin nganggo klambi biasa

1156
00:40:42,678 --> 00:40:43,150
Persis.

1157
00:40:43,544 --> 00:40:43,886
Ya

1158
00:40:44,036 --> 00:40:44,958
Yen ora kanggo dhèwèké

1159
00:40:45,169 --> 00:40:48,637
Sapa ngerti pira wong sing bakal digawa metu saka aula leluhur dina iki?

