Kita kudu ngoyak loro-lorone.

2240
01:19:42,753 --> 01:19:44,147
Kanthi penghasilan sing mlebu

2241
01:19:44,297 --> 01:19:45,591
Milisi desa ora perlu

2242
01:19:45,741 --> 01:19:46,835
nyicipi recehan manèh.

2243
01:19:47,275 --> 01:19:48,667
Nalika arep ngentekake dhuwit

2244
01:19:48,817 --> 01:19:51,213
Kita uga kudu nandur modal ing perawatan medis.

2245
01:19:51,450 --> 01:19:53,780
Ana luwih saka 300 wong ing Desa Qinghe.

2246
01:19:53,930 --> 01:19:55,938
Kanggo saiki, klinik cilik waé wis cukup.

2247
01:19:56,530 --> 01:19:57,814
Sing kokngerteni mung perang.

2248
01:19:57,964 --> 01:19:59,040
Aku takon karo kowé.

2249
01:19:59,190 --> 01:20:01,424
Yen milisi desa bakal dadi kekuatan nyata

2250
01:20:01,574 --> 01:20:03,602
kita butuh persediaan obat tatu sing akeh.

2251
01:20:03,752 --> 01:20:04,992
Utawa obat anestesi?

2252
01:20:05,142 --> 01:20:07,078
Apa kita kudu nyuling minuman keras sing kuwat

2253
01:20:07,228 --> 01:20:08,320
kanggo ngresiki tatu?

2254
01:20:08,470 --> 01:20:09,598
Yen ana gelut tenan...

2255
01:20:09,748 --> 01:20:13,442
Mungkasi getihen, ngurangi rasa lara, nambani tatu, lan nyuda demam.

2256
01:20:13,592 --> 01:20:14,604
Endi sing ora penting?

2257
01:20:14,754 --> 01:20:17,426
Sing kokdeleng mung pedhang, gandhewa, panah, lan panah.

2258
01:20:17,576 --> 01:20:20,448
Kepiye carane njaga nyawa yen sampeyan ora bisa ndeleng ajine?

2259
01:20:20,598 --> 01:20:23,708
Yen ana wong sing lara lan ora ana obat kanggo nylametake dhèwèké...

2260
01:20:23,858 --> 01:20:26,444
Apa gunane milisi desa sing wis dilatih kanthi apik?

2261
01:20:26,594 --> 01:20:28,218
Wanita enom iki, biasane

2262
01:20:28,368 --> 01:20:29,170
katon sepi banget

2263
01:20:29,968 --> 01:20:31,516
nanging nalika dhèwèké wiwit ngomong

2264
01:20:31,666 --> 01:20:33,602
dhèwèké ngerti bab-bab sing durung tau takrungu

2265
01:20:33,752 --> 01:20:35,290
Mung ngurusi urusan militer waé.

2266
01:20:35,440 --> 01:20:37,064
Yen aku pancen isa nggawé racun

2267
01:20:37,214 --> 01:20:38,964
