apa kowé kepingin?

2270
01:20:42,857 --> 01:20:43,619
Kuwi kejem banget.

2271
01:20:44,524 --> 01:20:47,522
Mesthi waé aku nindakake. Yagéné aku ora gelem?

2272
01:20:47,672 --> 01:20:49,982
Yen panah pancen isa diisi obat kaya ngene iki

2273
01:20:50,132 --> 01:20:52,088
Iku kaya nambahake swiwi ing macan.

2274
01:20:52,238 --> 01:20:55,604
Aku ora mikir aku bakal ngerti apa sing kadadian ing pikirane wong-wong iki.

2275
01:20:55,754 --> 01:20:56,836
Ora ing urip iki.

2276
01:20:58,020 --> 01:20:59,082
Kita isa nglakoni.

2277
01:20:59,232 --> 01:21:00,084
Apa bisa mlaku?

2278
01:21:00,234 --> 01:21:01,166
Kita kudu nyoba.

2279
01:21:01,316 --> 01:21:03,824
Nanging yen kowé ora menehi aku wong lanang siji-sijia

2280
01:21:03,974 --> 01:21:04,646
utawa dhuwit

2281
01:21:04,796 --> 01:21:06,434
Yen kowé ora menehi aku papan

2282
01:21:06,584 --> 01:21:08,276
Aku ora bisa ngrampungake apa-apa

2283
01:21:08,426 --> 01:21:08,738
Apik.

2284
01:21:09,059 --> 01:21:11,001
Ma Zhenbang ngembangake bengkel tukang kayu.

2285
01:21:11,151 --> 01:21:13,721
Tukang kayu tuwa kuwi entuk wolung guan saben sasi.

2286
01:21:13,871 --> 01:21:15,059
Ayo dhèwèké njupuk magang.

2287
01:21:15,209 --> 01:21:15,921
Nyetel kios.

2288
