Terus gawe kursi goyang.

2289
01:21:17,523 --> 01:21:19,613
Kita uga ora bisa mandheg nggawé panah tangan.

2290
01:21:19,763 --> 01:21:22,597
Kapisan, gawe desain kasebut bisa digunakake kanthi bener.

2291
01:21:22,747 --> 01:21:24,477
Banjur golèk cara kanggo nyepetake.

2292
01:21:24,627 --> 01:21:25,139
Rampung

2293
01:21:25,289 --> 01:21:26,535
Serahke iki marang aku.

2294
01:21:26,685 --> 01:21:28,593
Chen Su, kowé isa njupuk apotek kuwi.

2295
01:21:28,743 --> 01:21:31,173
Obat tatu, anestesi, minuman keras suling

2296
01:21:31,323 --> 01:21:33,011
Lan racun sing koksebutake mau

2297
01:21:33,161 --> 01:21:34,733
Kita bisa nyoba nggawé kabèh mau

2298
01:21:34,883 --> 01:21:35,945
Nanging ana siji bab.

2299
01:21:36,095 --> 01:21:38,203
Kita kudu entuk formula lan dosis sing tepat.

2300
01:21:38,353 --> 01:21:40,179
Aja nindakake apa-apa sing sembrono.

2301
01:21:40,329 --> 01:21:40,971
Aku ngerti.

2302
01:21:42,229 --> 01:21:43,101
Wiwit dina iki,

2303
