2305
01:21:46,775 --> 01:21:49,575
Pelatihan toko tukang kayu, apotek, lan milisi desa

2306
01:21:49,725 --> 01:21:51,205
Jaga saben akun tetep akurat.

2307
01:21:51,355 --> 01:21:52,603
Telung dina saka saiki,

2308
01:21:52,753 --> 01:21:56,245
Aku dhèwèké sing bakal mimpin tim menyang Qinzhou kanggo ngedol jaran-jaran kasebut.

2309
01:21:58,853 --> 01:21:59,565
Iku pancen dhèwèké.

2310
01:22:01,120 --> 01:22:05,644
Kula, Zhou Houde, kanthi andhap asor ngaturaken pakurmatan dhateng Hakim Kabupaten.

2311
01:22:05,794 --> 01:22:08,336
Ora perlu formalitas kaya ngono, Kepala Desa Zhou.

2312
01:22:08,486 --> 01:22:11,066
Aku kebetulan ketemu karo wong enom saka desamu kuwi

2313
