2314
01:22:12,950 --> 01:22:14,978
Kebetulan aku duwe wektu luang dina iki.

2315
01:22:15,128 --> 01:22:17,266
Dadi aku mikir arep mampir lan ngunjungi kowé.

2316
01:22:17,416 --> 01:22:20,480
Iku sawijining pakurmatan kanggo duwe Hakim Kabupaten ing kéné

2317
01:22:20,630 --> 01:22:21,976
Iku rejekine Desa Qinghe.

2318
01:22:22,126 --> 01:22:22,608
Nanging...

2319
01:22:23,026 --> 01:22:24,900
Nanging Wang Haochuan lan liya-liyane

2320
01:22:25,050 --> 01:22:27,088
Aku wedi yen saiki dhèwèké ora ana ing desa

2321
01:22:27,238 --> 01:22:28,010
Ora ing desa

2322
01:22:28,160 --> 01:22:30,006
Yang Mulia, iki lagi musim tanam.

2323
01:22:30,360 --> 01:22:32,340
Sanajan milisi desa wis diadegake

2324
01:22:32,490 --> 01:22:34,278
Nanging Lin Zhao netepake aturan.

2325
01:22:34,428 --> 01:22:36,858
Ora ana tetanen nalika mangsa tandur lan panen.

2326
01:22:37,008 --> 01:22:38,570
Latihan mung nalika wektu luang.

2327
01:22:38,720 --> 01:22:40,238
Wang Haochuan lan liya-liyane

2328
