2329
01:22:42,576 --> 01:22:44,216
Latih milisi ing wektu luangmu

2330
01:22:44,366 --> 01:22:45,932
Tani ora tau disepelekake.

2331
01:22:46,082 --> 01:22:47,332
Iku wis diatur kanthi apik.

2332
01:22:47,482 --> 01:22:48,314
Kaya ngene iki.

2333
01:22:48,464 --> 01:22:51,554
Kapisan, gawanen wong-wongku menyang desa lan dadèkna panggonané.

2334
01:22:51,704 --> 01:22:52,906
Ora perlu gawe rame.

2335
01:22:53,056 --> 01:22:54,254
Aku bakal mlaku-mlaku dhèwèké.

2336
01:22:54,404 --> 01:22:56,138
Aku arep mriksa lapangan-lapangane.

2337
01:22:56,288 --> 01:22:57,280
Hakim Kabupaten

2338
01:22:57,430 --> 01:22:57,822
iki

2339
01:22:58,030 --> 01:22:59,984
Aku metu nganggo klambi biasa dina iki.

2340
01:23:00,134 --> 01:23:02,162
Aku ora péngin narik kawigaten kakehan.

2341
01:23:02,312 --> 01:23:04,316
Lakoni waé apa sing dakkandhakake.

2342
01:23:04,466 --> 01:23:04,878
Oke

2343
01:23:13,733 --> 01:23:14,305
Wong enom.

2344
01:23:14,455 --> 01:23:16,283
Aku weruh sawahmu diurus kanthi becik.

2345
