Gunung Dawa nglindhungi kita saka angin lan bencana.

2359
01:23:47,167 --> 01:23:50,001
Pegunungan nyedhiyakake kayu, jamu, lan kewan buruan.

2360
01:23:50,151 --> 01:23:51,655
Iku bisa ditandur lan dibela.

2361
01:23:51,805 --> 01:23:54,203
Yen kita bisa ngliwati taun utawa rong taun ngarep

2362
01:23:54,353 --> 01:23:56,275
kahanane bisa uga malih dadi nyata

2363
01:23:56,425 --> 01:23:59,119
Yagéné kok kowé kandha yen kita kudu bisa urip rong taun iki?

2364
01:23:59,825 --> 01:24:01,803
Amarga kahanane bakal owah taun iki.

2365
01:24:01,953 --> 01:24:02,145
Oh. ...

2366
01:24:02,919 --> 01:24:03,811
Kepriyé bakal owah?

2367
