2371
01:24:11,684 --> 01:24:13,772
Kemungkinan bakal dicabut sithik mbaka sithik.

2372
01:24:13,922 --> 01:24:14,814
Nalika semana

2373
01:24:14,964 --> 01:24:17,736
sanajan Xia Kulon isih wani nyelidiki tapel wates kita

2374
