Sederhanane,

2378
01:24:26,230 --> 01:24:29,918
Rasa wedine yaiku Xia Kulon bakal nganggo kesempatan iki kanggo ngganggu kita.

2379
01:24:30,068 --> 01:24:32,762
Yen pasukan utama Dinasti Song kabèh ngawasi sisih lor

2380
01:24:32,912 --> 01:24:34,506
desa-desa ing tapel wates iki

2381
01:24:34,656 --> 01:24:36,712
bakal dadi wong pertama sing nandhang sangsara

2382
01:24:37,156 --> 01:24:39,044
Kowé ndeleng luwih jero tinimbang umumé wong.

2383
01:24:39,194 --> 01:24:41,822
Nanging kahanan ing sisih lor bisa uga ora kaya ngono

2384
01:24:41,972 --> 01:24:43,290
