2385
01:24:44,872 --> 01:24:45,944
Aku mung spekulasi.

2386
01:24:46,806 --> 01:24:49,118
Wong-wong ing tapel wates adoh saka pengadilan

2387
01:24:49,268 --> 01:24:51,508
Sing bisa dideleng mung ing ngendi pasukan dikirim

2388
01:24:52,034 --> 01:24:53,504
Lan ing ngendi gandum dikirim

2389
01:24:53,654 --> 01:24:56,224
Lan apa benteng tapel wates wis tentrem akhir-akhir iki

2390
01:24:56,374 --> 01:24:58,554
Amarga kita lagi ngrembug babagan sisih lor

2391
01:24:58,704 --> 01:25:00,996
Apa sing kudu ditindakake Dinasti Song miturutmu?

2392
01:25:01,146 --> 01:25:03,322
kanggo ngendhaleni ancaman saka njaba wates?

2393
01:25:03,472 --> 01:25:05,532
Yen mung ngomong babagan masa depan sing cedhak...

2394
01:25:05,682 --> 01:25:09,544
Latih pasukan, simpen perbekalan, bentengi benteng, lan atur ulang tentara.

2395
01:25:09,694 --> 01:25:11,486
Nanging yen kita mikir jangka panjang...

2396
01:25:11,636 --> 01:25:14,936
Bebaya sing sejatine dudu sepira kuwat utawa ringkih mungsuhe saiki.

2397
01:25:15,086 --> 01:25:19,212
Nanging ing jangka panjang, bebaya sing sejatine yaiku ngopeni asu ajag liyane dhèwèké.

2398
01:25:19,362 --> 01:25:20,164
Apa maksudmu?

2399
