Iku katon kaya cara sing luwih gampang.

2402
01:25:26,896 --> 01:25:29,600
Sejatine, dhèwèké nggunakaké siji pedhang kanggo matèni liyané.

2403
01:25:29,750 --> 01:25:32,180
Dhèwèké uga lagi ngopeni macan sing bakal noleh marang dhèwèké.

2404
01:25:32,330 --> 01:25:33,700
Macan ing ngarep kita wis galak

2405
01:25:33,850 --> 01:25:36,060
Lan asu ajag sing bakal teka bakal luwih luwe

2406
01:25:36,210 --> 01:25:38,334
Dina iki, kita ngandelake kekuwatane.

2407
01:25:38,484 --> 01:25:40,234
Sesuk, kita bakal mbayar regane.

2408
01:25:40,684 --> 01:25:42,170
Maksudmu aliansi Song-Jin.

2409
01:25:43,151 --> 01:25:44,361
Saking ngertosipun, Pak...

2410
01:25:44,511 --> 01:25:45,809
Ngapa aku kok kudu ngeja?

2411
01:25:46,378 --> 01:25:47,776
Sawise kabèh iki ngobrol

2412
01:25:47,926 --> 01:25:49,446
Apa aku oleh takon jenengmu, Pak?

2413
01:25:49,596 --> 01:25:51,182
Jeneng kulawargaku yaiku Di.

2414
01:25:51,332 --> 01:25:52,788
Jenengku sing asli yaiku Shen.

2415
01:25:53,832 --> 01:25:57,978
Dadi iku Hakim Di. Nyuwun pangapunten menawi kula boten ngajeni.

2416
01:25:58,128 --> 01:26:00,498
Amarga aku teka nganggo sandhangan biasa dina iki,

2417
01:26:00,648 --> 01:26:02,312
ora perlu formalitas kaya ngono.

2418
01:26:02,462 --> 01:26:04,044
Anggap waé kuwi obrolan santai.

2419
01:26:04,194 --> 01:26:04,536
Ya

2420
01:26:05,128 --> 01:26:06,392
Dadi kowé kuwi Lin Zhao.

2421
01:26:06,594 --> 01:26:07,066
Persis.

2422
01:26:07,561 --> 01:26:09,373
Kowé pancèn béda karo wong liya ing désamu

2423
01:26:09,523 --> 01:26:10,155
sawise kabèh

2424
01:26:16,789 --> 01:26:17,899
Kita wis cukup istirahat

2425
01:26:18,049 --> 01:26:19,895
Wektune rampung lan bali menyang desa

2426
01:26:20,045 --> 01:26:21,673
Iki milisi desa sing koklatih

2427
