kéné...

2428
01:26:23,845 --> 01:26:25,565
Nggarap sawah nalika mangsa tandur.

2429
01:26:25,715 --> 01:26:27,343
Dheweke latihan ing wektu luang.

2430
01:26:27,493 --> 01:26:28,603
Tanah ora bisa goroh.

2431
01:26:28,753 --> 01:26:30,201
Lan wong lanang kudu tetep landhep.

2432
01:26:37,053 --> 01:26:40,867
Aku mikir sing diarani milisi desa iku ora luwih saka desa tapel wates

2433
01:26:41,017 --> 01:26:42,779
cepet-cepet digabung supaya katon megah

2434
01:26:43,184 --> 01:26:45,730
Nanging sawise ndeleng nganggo mripatku dhèwèk, aku sadhar

2435
01:26:45,880 --> 01:26:48,404
Senajan kekuwatan iki isih kasar ing pinggir-pinggire,

2436
01:26:48,554 --> 01:26:51,072
Nanging dhèwèké wis wiwit ngluwihi milisi desa biasa.

2437
01:26:51,222 --> 01:26:53,092
betapa kacaunya mereka sebetulnya.

2438
01:26:53,242 --> 01:26:53,994
Iki minangka

2439
01:26:54,144 --> 01:26:54,876
panah tangan.

2440
01:26:55,111 --> 01:26:56,245
Isih nggawé pangaturan.

2441
01:26:56,395 --> 01:26:57,563
Kowé uga sing nggawé iki.

2442
01:26:57,795 --> 01:27:00,831
Sawetara warga desa padha ngrembug bab iku kanthi bebarengan.

2443
01:27:00,981 --> 01:27:03,335
Desa sing penduduké mung luwih saka telung atus wong

2444
01:27:03,485 --> 01:27:04,811
Desa perbatasan sing adoh

2445
01:27:04,961 --> 01:27:06,745
Bisa dilatih sajrone wektu sing cendhak

2446
01:27:06,895 --> 01:27:08,961
lan milisi desa sing isih anyar kaya iki

2447
01:27:09,111 --> 01:27:09,773
Luwih penting,

2448
01:27:10,344 --> 01:27:11,892
Cara iki ora mung teoretis.

2449
01:27:12,377 --> 01:27:14,007
nanging dijalin kanthi kukuh ing

2450
