mangsa, tanah, lan urip ing desa

2451
01:27:18,157 --> 01:27:19,541
Apa sing dienggo nutupi raine?

2452
01:27:19,691 --> 01:27:20,453
Panutup rai

2453
01:27:21,524 --> 01:27:23,974
Tutupen irung lan cangkemmu nalika ngrawat wong lara.

2454
01:27:24,124 --> 01:27:26,570
