02:28:06,827 --> 02:28:07,019
Oh. ...

4012
02:28:07,493 --> 02:28:08,603
Apa sing kokbutuhake?

4013
02:28:08,753 --> 02:28:10,435
Obat-obatan lan barang-barang wesi

4014
02:28:10,585 --> 02:28:11,077
Uga,

4015
02:28:11,227 --> 02:28:13,615
Aku nggoleki sawetara pandhe wesi sing trampil banget

4016
02:28:13,765 --> 02:28:15,149
gelem manggon ing Desa Qinghe.

4017
02:28:16,098 --> 02:28:17,626
Obat-obatan lan piranti wesi

4018
02:28:17,776 --> 02:28:20,816
Sanajan sawetara obat-obatan lan barang wesi dilarang didol

4019
02:28:20,966 --> 02:28:22,950
Karo aku ing kéné, ora bakal dadi masalah

4020
02:28:23,100 --> 02:28:24,946
Ana akeh apotek ing Kutha Qinzhou.

4021
02:28:25,096 --> 02:28:26,850
Ana uga akeh toko pandhe wesi.

4022
02:28:27,000 --> 02:28:29,470
Nanging nemokake pandhe wesi sing gelem manggon ing deso

4023
02:28:29,620 --> 02:28:31,666
gumantung saka katrampilan lan keberuntungan.

4024
02:28:31,816 --> 02:28:32,888
Anggere dhèwèké trampil.

4025
02:28:33,183 --> 02:28:34,249
Regane bisa dirembug.

4026
02:28:36,883 --> 02:28:37,435
Krungu apik.

4027
02:28:37,783 --> 02:28:39,029
Serahke iki marang aku.

4028
02:28:39,216 --> 02:28:41,858
Aku bakal nemokake obat sing paling apik kanggo Kakang Lin.

4029
02:28:42,008 --> 02:28:44,650
Aku uga bakal njaluk wong takon babagan piranti wesi.

4030
02:28:44,800 --> 02:28:45,916
Dene kanggo pandhe wesi...

4031
02:28:46,066 --> 02:28:47,720
Aku bakal njaluk wong sing ngawasi.

4032
02:28:47,870 --> 02:28:50,230
Menawi wonten tiyang ingkang kersa ninggalaken kitha,

4033
02:28:50,380 --> 02:28:52,730
Aku mesthi bakal nyaranake dhèwèké menyang Sedulur Lin.

4034
02:28:54,180 --> 02:28:55,636
Matur nuwun, Sedulur Zhong.

4035
02:29:00,080 --> 02:29:02,294
Sedulur Lin, kepiye carane nganggo panah iki?

4036
02:29:02,444 --> 02:29:04,082
Kepriyé carane nembak nalika perang?

4037
02:29:04,711 --> 02:29:07,141
Pasang baut, tarik taline, lan tarik pelatukne.

4038
02:29:07,291 --> 02:29:08,757
Tujuk, banjur pencet ing kéné.

4039
02:29:08,907 --> 02:29:09,689
Iku duwekmu.

4040
02:29:09,839 --> 02:29:10,271
Tenan?

4041
02:29:10,606 --> 02:29:11,188
Jupuk waé.

4042
02:29:19,473 --> 02:29:20,215
Sedulur Lin

4043
02:29:20,365 --> 02:29:22,183
Sesuk, aku bakal ngongkon wong ngirim

4044
02:29:22,333 --> 02:29:23,651
barang menyang penginapanmu

4045
02:29:23,801 --> 02:29:24,603
Matur nuwun sanget.

4046
02:29:29,867 --> 02:29:30,869
I-iki Pangeran Qin...

4047
02:29:32,834 --> 02:29:33,176
Inggih.

4048
02:29:47,967 --> 02:29:48,539
Wong enom

4049
02:29:48,867 --> 02:29:49,995
Kowé dudu wong kéné, ta?

4050
02:29:50,234 --> 02:29:51,752
Kowé wani tuku wanita enom iki?

4051
02:29:51,902 --> 02:29:53,070
Dheweke saka Klan Qin.

4052
02:29:53,302 --> 02:29:54,394
Kepriyé karo Klan Qin?

4053
02:29:57,202 --> 02:29:59,228
Dhèwèké putriné Master Qin Kapindho saka selir.

4054
02:29:59,378 --> 02:30:01,966
Guru Kapindho nembe seda sawetara dina kepungkur.

4055
02:30:02,116 --> 02:30:03,600
Dheweke malah durung suwé mati.

4056
02:30:03,750 --> 02:30:05,576
Cabang pisanan meksa ibune pegatan

4057
02:30:05,726 --> 02:30:07,634
Banjur padha ngusir dhèwèké tanpa apa-apa

4058
02:30:07,784 --> 02:30:09,952
Bocah wadon kuwi nduwèni sipat sing gampang nesu.

4059
02:30:10,102 --> 02:30:12,744
Dadi saiki dhèwèké ngedol awake dhèwèké kanggo ngubur ibune.

4060
02:30:12,894 --> 02:30:15,354
Dheweke mbokmenawa mung péngin ngremehake Klan Qin.

4061
02:30:15,504 --> 02:30:16,486
Apa kowé ora weruh?

4062
02:30:16,636 --> 02:30:17,872
Ora ana sing wani tuku.

4063
02:30:18,369 --> 02:30:20,733
Turuta pituture wong tuwa iki lan budhal saiki.

4064
02:30:20,883 --> 02:30:22,459
Klan Qin praktis mrentah Qinzhou.

4065
02:30:23,183 --> 02:30:24,035
Yen kowé tuku dhèwèké,

4066
02:30:24,185 --> 02:30:25,713
kowé bakal dadi mungsuhé Klan Qin.

4067
02:30:25,863 --> 02:30:26,895
Ing wilayah Qinzhou

4068
02:30:27,045 --> 02:30:29,303
Urip ora bakal gampang kanggo kowé wiwit saiki

4069
02:30:34,078 --> 02:30:37,402
Pangéran paling tuwa saka Klan Qin meksa garwané kakangné sing nomer telu

4070
02:30:37,552 --> 02:30:39,210
ngusir bocah wadon yatim piatu

4071
02:30:39,360 --> 02:30:40,402
Prilaku kaya ngono

4072
02:30:40,552 --> 02:30:42,100
Malah luwih njijiki tinimbang

4073
02:30:42,250 --> 02:30:44,686
Kekerasan terbuka sing wis dakdeleng ing medan perang

4074
02:30:54,884 --> 02:30:57,306
Klan Qin malah ora bisa nemokake telung puluh Guan.

4075
02:30:57,456 --> 02:30:59,446
Banjur aku bakal mbayar telung puluh guan.

4076
02:31:03,223 --> 02:31:05,117
Sapa jeneng kulawarga panjenengan, Pak?

4077
02:31:05,267 --> 02:31:06,069
Kowé saka ngendi?

4078
02:31:07,234 --> 02:31:08,086
Aku Lin Zhao.

4079
02:31:08,667 --> 02:31:10,647
Saka Desa Qinghe, Kabupaten Longcheng

4080
02:31:13,467 --> 02:31:16,369
Matur nuwun, Tuan Muda Xie, kanggo tumindakmu sing mulya.

4081
02:31:16,519 --> 02:31:17,301
Aku Qin Hongying

4082
02:31:18,152 --> 02:31:20,454
Lan aku bakal dadi duwekmu sajrone uripku

4083
02:31:20,604 --> 02:31:22,914
Aku bakal nuruti kekarepanmu tanpa alesan.

4084
02:31:24,671 --> 02:31:25,815
Tulung, kowé ora kena.

4085
02:31:26,338 --> 02:31:27,872
Aku mung mbantu ngubur ibumu.

4086
02:31:28,204 --> 02:31:29,554
Aku ora duwe niyat tuku kowé.

4087
02:31:29,704 --> 02:31:31,454
Anggep dhuwit iki minangka pitulungan.

4088
02:31:31,604 --> 02:31:33,248
Ora perlu mbales budi marang aku.

4089
02:31:40,871 --> 02:31:43,479
Panjenengan manggen wonten pundi sapunika, Tuan Muda?

4090
02:31:43,629 --> 02:31:44,941
Sawisé Hongying ngubur ibuné

4091
02:31:45,091 --> 02:31:46,673
dhèwèké bakal teka ngladèni kowé dhéwé.

4092
02:31:46,823 --> 02:31:49,115
Kita teka menyang Qinzhou kanggo urusan bisnis.

4093
02:31:49,265 --> 02:31:52,045
Saiki kita nginep ing Yuelai Inn ing sisih kidul kutha.

4094
02:31:52,195 --> 02:31:54,675
Sumangga ibu panjenengan tilar donya kanthi tentrem.

4095
02:31:54,825 --> 02:31:55,797
Ora usah kuwatir.

4096
02:31:56,458 --> 02:31:57,440
Aku wis mbayar kowé.

4097
02:31:57,590 --> 02:31:58,322
Kita imbang.

4098
02:32:01,324 --> 02:32:03,000
Bocah wadon iki pancen wangkot banget.

4099
02:32:21,757 --> 02:32:22,619
Sedulur lanang

4100
02:32:22,769 --> 02:32:24,249
Stok kita wis kebak wektu iki.

4101
02:32:26,602 --> 02:32:28,592
Yagéné tuku saltpeter lan belerang akeh banget?

4102
02:32:28,742 --> 02:32:31,932
Apa Ibu Tua ngrencanakake mbangun pabrik senjata ing negara kita?

4103
02:32:32,082 --> 02:32:32,784
Desa Qinghe?

4104
02:32:39,849 --> 02:32:40,231
Hei. ...

4105
02:32:40,381 --> 02:32:41,203
Sedulur Xie

4106
02:32:41,353 --> 02:32:45,093
Deloken bocah wadon sing ana ing cedhak lawang kuwi. Dhèwèké ayu banget.

4107
02:32:45,243 --> 02:32:46,315
Bedhil dhèwèké katon galak.

4108
02:32:54,076 --> 02:32:54,898
Tuan Muda Lin

4109
02:32:55,143 --> 02:32:56,455
Hongying wis ngubur ibune.

4110
02:32:57,276 --> 02:32:59,616
Aku teka kanggo ngladeni panjenengan, Tuan Muda.

4111
02:32:59,766 --> 02:33:00,068
Ah...

4112
02:33:06,333 --> 02:33:07,195
Sedulur lanang

4113
02:33:07,345 --> 02:33:08,811
Apa sing koklakoni wingi bengi?

4114
02:33:08,961 --> 02:33:11,171
Bocah wadon iki katon kaya dudu wong biasa.

4115
02:33:11,321 --> 02:33:12,343
Bedhil sing digawa dhèwèké

4116
02:33:12,493 --> 02:33:14,857
dudu barang sing bisa ditanggung kulawarga biasa

4117
02:33:15,007 --> 02:33:15,469
Nona.

4118
02:33:15,619 --> 02:33:16,685
Aku wis ngandhani kowé.

4119
02:33:16,835 --> 02:33:18,797
Dhuwit kuwi dimaksudake kanggo mbantu kowé.

4120
02:33:18,947 --> 02:33:20,437
Iku ora kanggo tuku sliramu.

4121
02:33:20,587 --> 02:33:23,263
Yen sampeyan duwe kanca utawa kulawarga, dolan menyang dhèwèké.

4122
02:33:23,413 --> 02:33:24,759
Kowé ora perlu ngetutaké aku.

4123
02:33:26,346 --> 02:33:27,008
Tuan enom

4124
02:33:27,380 --> 02:33:28,764
Sawisé ibuku tilar donya

4125
02:33:28,914 --> 02:33:31,334
Hongying wis ora duwe kulawarga manèh ing donya iki

4126
02:33:31,484 --> 02:33:32,776
Wiwit aku njupuk dhuwitmu,

4127
02:33:32,926 --> 02:33:34,708
Aku wis ngedol awakku dhèwèké marang kowé.

4128
02:33:34,858 --> 02:33:36,362
Yen kowé ora gelem nampa aku...

4129
02:33:36,992 --> 02:33:37,504
Hongying

4130
02:33:38,158 --> 02:33:40,228
Hongying mung bisa ngucurake getihe ing kéné

4131
02:33:40,378 --> 02:33:43,164
lan males kabecikanmu sing gedhé nganggo raga sing remuk iki.

4132
02:33:43,314 --> 02:33:44,882
Aku bakal ngeterake kowé mlebu.

4133
02:33:45,032 --> 02:33:45,494
Nona

4134
02:33:45,732 --> 02:33:47,126
Adhiku kudu ngeterake kowé.

4135
02:33:47,532 --> 02:33:49,416
Xie Changfeng, kowé lagi dolanan apa?

4136
02:33:49,566 --> 02:33:51,248
Aja gawe kahanan dadi luwih elek.

4137
02:33:51,398 --> 02:33:55,442
Kepriyé carane kowé ngyakinake aku supaya ngajak Qiao Niang mlebu nalika semana?

4138
02:33:55,592 --> 02:33:57,470
Kowé uga nylametaké bocah wadon iki,

4139
02:33:57,620 --> 02:34:00,070
dadi apa kuwi ora bakal nggawé kowé dadi penyelamate dhèwèké?

4140
02:34:00,220 --> 02:34:00,932
Lin Shetou

4141
02:34:01,082 --> 02:34:02,134
Dhèwèké katon mesakaké banget.

4142
02:34:02,284 --> 02:34:04,614
Lan aja nganti penampilane sing alus ngapusi kowé.

4143
02:34:04,764 --> 02:34:05,984
Tombak kuwi ora entheng.

4144
02:34:06,164 --> 02:34:09,036
Yagéné dhèwèké ora ngajak bali menyang Desa Qinghe bareng karo kita?

4145
02:34:09,186 --> 02:34:11,218
Dhèwèké malah bisa mbantu nglatih pasukan kita.

4146
02:34:11,368 --> 02:34:11,760
Iya.

4147
02:34:11,935 --> 02:34:12,925
Wiwit kowé mbayar dhèwèké,

4148
02:34:13,075 --> 02:34:14,449
kowé kudu tanggung jawab marang dhèwèké.

4149
02:34:14,599 --> 02:34:17,307
Dheweke saiki wis ora duwe sapa-sapa manèh ing donya iki.

4150
02:34:17,457 --> 02:34:19,299
Dhèwèké ora bisa tetep ana ing Qinzhou manèh.

4151
02:34:19,449 --> 02:34:22,143
Siji wong manèh ing Desa Qinghe kita ora bakal nglarani.

4152
02:34:22,293 --> 02:34:23,467
Kok isih gawe alesan?

4153
02:34:24,927 --> 02:34:25,239
Apik.

4154
02:34:25,727 --> 02:34:26,769
Yen pancen péngin melu,

4155
02:34:26,919 --> 02:34:28,697
banjur bali menyang Desa Qinghe dhisik.

4156
02:34:28,847 --> 02:34:30,141
Nanging aku ora tuku kowé.

4157
02:34:30,291 --> 02:34:32,017
Kowé mung wong désa saka Désa Qinghe.

4158
02:34:32,167 --> 02:34:33,719
Wiwit saiki, golèk nafkah dhèwèké.

4159
02:34:33,869 --> 02:34:35,047
Ora perlu ngenteni aku.

4160
02:34:35,269 --> 02:34:36,855
Matur nuwun, Tuan Muda Xie.

4161
02:34:37,005 --> 02:34:38,293
Hongying bakal kerja keras.

4162
02:34:38,443 --> 02:34:40,009
Aku ora bakal ngalang-alangi kowé.

4163
02:34:40,159 --> 02:34:41,021
Sedulur lanang

4164
02:34:41,171 --> 02:34:42,649
Ora bisa ngomong yen aku weruh.

4165
02:34:42,799 --> 02:34:45,019
Kowé pancèn nggunakaké lelungan kuwi kanthi optimal.

4166
02:34:45,169 --> 02:34:47,177
Katoné kowé bali nggawa barang sing lumayan akèh.

4167
02:34:48,269 --> 02:34:50,081
Iki ora nylametake bocah wadon.

4168
02:34:50,231 --> 02:34:54,137
Kowé ora mung nylametaké bocah wadon waé. Kowé nggawa mulih akèh masalah.

4169
02:34:59,031 --> 02:34:59,743
Ayo budhal.

4170
02:34:59,893 --> 02:35:01,935
Kanggo ngrayakake suksese proses pasokan...

4171
02:35:02,085 --> 02:35:03,463
Lan kanggo nampani sing anyar

4172
02:35:03,613 --> 02:35:04,095
anyar

4173
02:35:04,245 --> 02:35:04,837
pasangan

4174
02:35:05,178 --> 02:35:07,258
Ayo pesta ing Menara Qinfeng manèh bengi iki.

4175
02:35:07,408 --> 02:35:07,720
Apik.

4176
02:35:15,041 --> 02:35:16,063
Sing nduwe penginapan!

4177
02:35:16,213 --> 02:35:16,985
Metu saka kéné!

4178
02:35:18,346 --> 02:35:19,188
Tuan Muda Qin

4179
02:35:19,338 --> 02:35:21,686
Apa sing nggawa kowé menyang papanku sing sederhana iki?

4180
02:35:26,572 --> 02:35:28,970
Kowé sing mènèhi dhuwit marang Qin Hongying sing mesakaké kuwi.

4181
02:35:29,305 --> 02:35:30,287
Kowé ana ing kono.

4182
02:35:30,437 --> 02:35:33,655
Yen dideleng saka caramu nganggo klambi, kowé mesthi saka njaba kutha.

4183
02:35:33,805 --> 02:35:35,737
Apa kowé wani melu-melu urusan Klan Qin?

4184
02:35:35,887 --> 02:35:37,147
Kowé duwé kekarepan mati.

4185
02:35:39,054 --> 02:35:39,896
Tuan Muda Qin

4186
02:35:40,046 --> 02:35:43,106
Nylametake wong sing ana ing bebaya iku pancen tumindak sing bener.

4187
02:35:43,256 --> 02:35:44,534
Aku mung menehi bantuan.

4188
02:35:44,789 --> 02:35:46,817
Ngapa aku kudu melu-melu urusan Klan Qin?

4189
02:35:46,967 --> 02:35:48,687
Apa aku kudu disalahake karo kowé

4190
02:35:48,837 --> 02:35:50,979
kanggo nindakake kabecikan lan mbantu wong liya?

4191
02:35:51,129 --> 02:35:52,301
Nindakake tumindak becik

4192
02:35:52,451 --> 02:35:54,815
Apa ana wong saka Klan Qinku sing butuh bantuanmu?

4193
02:35:54,965 --> 02:35:56,887
Wong njaba kaya kowé sing meranke pahlawan?

4194
02:35:57,037 --> 02:35:58,257
Kowé mikir kowé kuwi sapa?

4195
02:35:58,437 --> 02:35:59,469
Ing wilayah Qinzhou

4196
02:35:59,770 --> 02:36:01,592
Malah amal uga dudu panggonanmu.

4197
02:36:01,742 --> 02:36:02,244
Tangkep dhèwèké!

4198
02:36:02,742 --> 02:36:03,876
Tangkep wong bodho iki

4199
02:36:04,026 --> 02:36:05,752
wong lanang sing ora ngerti panggonane!

4200
02:36:05,902 --> 02:36:06,704
Tugel sikile.

4201
02:36:06,935 --> 02:36:09,505
Jalukna dhèwèké sinau sapa sing sakjané mréntah Qinzhou.

4202
02:36:11,802 --> 02:36:12,664
Sedulur lanang

4203
02:36:13,269 --> 02:36:15,167
Apa iki alesan sing nyesel kanggo wong lanang?

4204
02:36:15,317 --> 02:36:16,817
cukup kanggo angetke awak kita?

4205
