4206
02:36:20,151 --> 02:36:21,357
Koyone kowé njaluk mati.

4207
02:36:30,084 --> 02:36:30,746
Ya ampun!

4208
02:36:36,251 --> 02:36:37,153
Kowe pelacur cilik

4209
02:36:37,584 --> 02:36:38,896
Apa kowé ora duwe isin?

4210
02:36:39,046 --> 02:36:40,376
Apa sing koklakoni ing kéné

4211
02:36:40,526 --> 02:36:41,748
Nongkrong karo wong-wong iki?

4212
02:36:41,959 --> 02:36:43,973
Kaya ibumu sing diarani berbudi pekerti.

4213
02:36:46,026 --> 02:36:46,878
Kowé njaluk mati.

4214
02:36:52,592 --> 02:36:53,064
Mundur.

4215
02:36:53,214 --> 02:36:54,216
Mundur, saiki!

4216
02:36:57,548 --> 02:36:58,060
Hongying

4217
02:36:58,210 --> 02:36:59,420
Aja ngoyak wong-wong mau.

4218
02:36:59,570 --> 02:37:01,214
Aja ngoyak mungsuh sing wis kepojok

4219
02:37:01,364 --> 02:37:02,984
Iki ana ing njero Kutha Qinzhou.

4220
02:37:03,134 --> 02:37:04,634
Yen kita ngoyak lan nglarani dhèwèké

4221
02:37:04,784 --> 02:37:06,744
Aku wedi iki ora bakal rampung kanthi apik

4222
02:37:06,894 --> 02:37:08,086
Ayo aja nggawa iki

4223
02:37:08,236 --> 02:37:09,944
masalah sing ora perlu kanggo awake dhèwèk

4224
02:37:10,094 --> 02:37:10,666
Nona Qin

4225
02:37:10,816 --> 02:37:12,262
Pancen pertunjukan kekuwatan.

4226
02:37:12,412 --> 02:37:14,728
Keahlian menembakmu bisa nandingi siapa pun.

4227
02:37:14,878 --> 02:37:16,688
Nanging yen sampeyan ora metu dina iki

4228
02:37:16,838 --> 02:37:18,516
bocah-bocah iki bakal digebugi banget.

4229
02:37:19,105 --> 02:37:19,977
