fokus nangani masalah ing kéné.

4890
03:06:34,678 --> 03:06:37,056
Sadurunge sampeyan ninggalake Kabupaten Qingshui

4891
03:06:37,206 --> 03:06:38,956
Yen sampeyan nemoni kesulitan apa waé

4892
03:06:39,106 --> 03:06:40,138
langsung tekan Yao

4893
03:06:40,639 --> 03:06:41,879
Kabecikanmu dina iki

4894
03:06:42,029 --> 03:06:44,129
luwih penting kanggo aku tinimbang sing kokngerteni.

4895
03:06:44,279 --> 03:06:46,057
Kita duwe akeh wektu ing ngarep kita.

4896
03:06:49,612 --> 03:06:50,384
Kakang lanang

4897
03:06:50,534 --> 03:06:52,332
Apa saiki ora butuh jabatan resmi?

4898
03:06:52,482 --> 03:06:54,486
Kuwi Komandan Patroli, peringkat 8!

4899
03:06:54,636 --> 03:06:57,124
Inggih. Yen pancen kita menyang Xizhou...

4900
03:06:57,274 --> 03:06:59,156
Kowé bakal resmi dadi pejabat pemerintah.

4901
03:07:01,874 --> 03:07:02,716
Status resmi

4902
03:07:03,307 --> 03:07:04,995
Komandan Patroli Pangkat Kawolu

4903
03:07:05,145 --> 03:07:07,485
Dadi kepriyé yen dhèwèké Hakim Kabupaten peringkat 7?

4904
03:07:07,635 --> 03:07:08,537
Krungu apik tenan.

4905
03:07:09,068 --> 03:07:11,038
Apa pentinge ing kéné ing sisih lor-kulon

4906
03:07:11,235 --> 03:07:14,329
Sanajan hakim kabupatén tingkat kapitu ora ana sing istimewa

4907
03:07:14,479 --> 03:07:18,537
Ora preduli sepira apike posisine, tetep waé gumantung marang welas asihe wong liya.

4908
03:07:18,687 --> 03:07:20,053
Aku ngajeni kowé dina iki

4909
03:07:20,203 --> 03:07:22,467
Dadi aku bakal nggawé kowé dadi Komandan Patroli

4910
03:07:22,617 --> 03:07:24,251
Yen sesuk dhèwèké ora seneng karo kowé

4911
03:07:24,401 --> 03:07:26,529
siji tembung waé wis cukup kanggo nggawé kowé ambruk

4912
03:07:26,679 --> 03:07:28,375
Bab kaya ngono pungkasané ora ana oyot.

4913
03:07:29,446 --> 03:07:30,764
Nanging Desa Qinghe beda.

4914
03:07:31,046 --> 03:07:33,188
Senajan cilik, panggonan kuwi duweke kita—

4915
03:07:33,338 --> 03:07:35,264
pondasi sing kita bangun sithik mbaka sithik.

4916
03:07:35,414 --> 03:07:37,504
Kita duwé gandum, wesi, lan bengkel.

4917
03:07:37,654 --> 03:07:39,710
Lan wong-wong sing gelem ngorbanake nyawane.

4918
03:07:39,860 --> 03:07:42,128
Kanthi oyot sing kuwat kaya ngene, bakal thukul.

4919
03:07:42,278 --> 03:07:44,256
Wit kasebut kanthi alami bakal thukul munggah.

4920
03:07:44,444 --> 03:07:45,186
Dheweke Tou

4921
03:07:45,336 --> 03:07:45,978
Maksudmu

4922
03:07:46,269 --> 03:07:48,427
anggere wit ing Desa Qinghe iki terus thukul

4923
03:07:48,577 --> 03:07:51,555
cabang-cabange bakal nutupi Kabupaten Longcheng sawijining dina

4924
03:07:51,705 --> 03:07:52,517
banjur Qinzhou

4925
03:07:52,838 --> 03:07:54,476
lan pungkasané kabèh sisih lor-kulon

4926
03:07:54,626 --> 03:07:55,288
Aku mikir

4927
03:07:55,493 --> 03:07:56,445
dhèwèké mung ora gelem

4928
03:07:56,693 --> 03:07:58,933
ninggalake Desa Qinghe ing wektu kaya ngene iki

4929
03:07:59,083 --> 03:07:59,855
Sak lawase

4930
03:08:00,005 --> 03:08:02,047
sing diregani dudu jabatan resmi sing cilik

4931
03:08:02,197 --> 03:08:03,581
nanging kabèh sisih lor-kulon

4932
03:08:03,731 --> 03:08:04,743
Aku ngremehake dhèwèké.

4933
03:08:05,764 --> 03:08:08,644
Dhèwèké mbuwang oyot wit iki kanggo jabatan tingkat wolu sing kurang

4934
03:08:08,794 --> 03:08:10,818
Mung kanggo posisi peringkat wolu sing kurang apik

4935
03:08:10,968 --> 03:08:12,088
Apa aku iki bodho?

4936
03:08:12,238 --> 03:08:12,630
Iya.

4937
03:08:12,780 --> 03:08:13,102
Cukup.

4938
03:08:13,252 --> 03:08:14,382
Mandheg ngadeg-ngadeg waé.

4939
03:08:14,532 --> 03:08:15,840
Siyap-siyap dhèwèké bengi iki.

4940
03:08:15,990 --> 03:08:17,720
Tumindak miturut rencana sesuk esuk.

4941
03:08:20,090 --> 03:08:21,722
Hongying, kenapa kowé durung lunga?

4942
03:08:23,090 --> 03:08:24,564
Aku arep lunga karo kowé sesuk.

4943
03:08:24,714 --> 03:08:25,636
Aku kudu lunga.

4944
03:08:25,786 --> 03:08:27,920
Ora ana sing luwih ngerti Klan Qin tinimbang aku.

4945
03:08:28,070 --> 03:08:29,680
Yen kowé ora ngajak aku karo kowé

4946
03:08:29,830 --> 03:08:30,802
kowé lan Li Kui waé

4947
03:08:30,952 --> 03:08:33,266
bisa uga ora bisa ngrampungake iki kanthi resik

4948
03:08:33,416 --> 03:08:34,578
Kejaba Qin Yuanhao,

4949
03:08:35,183 --> 03:08:38,397
Aku iki siji-sijine keturunan langsung saka Klan Qin sing isih ana.

4950
03:08:38,547 --> 03:08:39,671
Yen Klan Qin tiba...

4951
03:08:39,821 --> 03:08:42,517
Wong-wong mau mung bakal mikir babagan njupuk kanggo awake dhèwèké.

4952
03:08:42,667 --> 03:08:44,153
Nanging yen aku ana ing kéné...

4953
03:08:44,303 --> 03:08:45,175
Aku isa nyekel.

4954
03:08:45,903 --> 03:08:47,499
nerusake saka ngendi mandhege

4955
03:08:47,649 --> 03:08:48,241
Bener kuwi.

4956
03:08:48,391 --> 03:08:50,135
Sawise kita nguwasani Klan Qin

4957
03:08:50,285 --> 03:08:51,433
dhèwèké bakal terus ngirim

4958
03:08:51,583 --> 03:08:54,571
dhuwit, gandum, lan wesi menyang Desa Qinghe tanpa wates

4959
03:08:54,721 --> 03:08:55,841
Apa kowé ora ngomong

4960
03:08:55,991 --> 03:08:57,749
Desa Qinghe kudu thukul munggah kaya wit?

4961
03:08:57,899 --> 03:08:59,465
Sawise kita nguntal Klan Qin

4962
03:08:59,615 --> 03:09:01,297
Desa Qinghe bisa berkembang luwih cepet

4963
03:09:01,447 --> 03:09:01,979
Ya wis.

4964
03:09:02,129 --> 03:09:04,195
Sesuk, balia menyang Qinzhou karo aku.

4965
03:09:04,345 --> 03:09:04,807
Tenan.

4966
03:09:05,145 --> 03:09:06,515
Ngapa aku kok ngapusi kowé?

4967
03:09:06,665 --> 03:09:07,933
Apa manèh sing kudu kok omongaké?

4968
03:09:08,083 --> 03:09:09,065
Ora ana apa-apa.

4969
03:09:09,816 --> 03:09:10,768
K-kowé kuduné istirahat.

4970
03:09:16,716 --> 03:09:19,118
Apa Tuan Muda Lin ora bakal bali bareng karo kita?

4971
03:09:19,316 --> 03:09:22,448
Isih ana siji perkara sing durung rampung kanggo ditinggal ing Qinzhou.

4972
03:09:22,598 --> 03:09:23,520
Yen ana sing salah-

4973
03:09:24,165 --> 03:09:26,677
Tuan Muda Lin bisa uga nemokake Yao kapan waé.

4974
03:09:26,827 --> 03:09:28,057
Matur nuwun, Pak Yao.

4975
03:09:34,660 --> 03:09:35,402
Dheweke Tou

4976
03:09:35,552 --> 03:09:38,002
Kepriyé carane kita nindakake langkah kita bengi iki?

4977
03:09:38,152 --> 03:09:40,088
Kita bakal ngobrol sawise tekan kutha.

4978
03:09:40,238 --> 03:09:42,306
Yen kita nindakake gerakan kita bengi iki

4979
03:09:42,456 --> 03:09:44,752
Aku bakal nggawa kowé mlebu liwat gapura kulon

4980
03:09:44,902 --> 03:09:46,632
Ana plataran sisih ing saburine

4981
03:09:46,782 --> 03:09:48,280
Kita bakal tekan Qinzhou dhisik

4982
03:09:52,382 --> 03:09:54,608
Sawise peteng, aku bakal ngajak kowé mlebu

4983
03:09:54,758 --> 03:09:55,580
Tindakake aku

4984
03:09:59,725 --> 03:10:01,657
She Tou, apa sing kita lakoni ing kéné?

4985
03:10:01,807 --> 03:10:03,033
Kanggo ketemu karo wong liya.

4986
03:10:05,273 --> 03:10:07,137
Kakang Lin, pungkasané kowé bisa bali.

4987
03:10:07,287 --> 03:10:08,401
Aku mung mikirke kowé.

4988
03:10:09,754 --> 03:10:10,696
Apa sing kadadian?

4989
03:10:10,921 --> 03:10:11,743
Sedulur Chong

4990
03:10:11,893 --> 03:10:13,599
Aku kepingin ketemu Gubernur Zhong.

4991
03:10:13,749 --> 03:10:16,175
Aku duwé prakara rahasia gedhé sing arep daklaporaké.

4992
03:10:16,325 --> 03:10:18,059
Pakdhe kula boten wonten ing kutha.

4993
03:10:18,209 --> 03:10:20,007
Yen sampeyan percaya karo Sedulur Lin

4994
03:10:20,157 --> 03:10:21,511
kowé isa waé critakna dhisik

4995
03:10:21,661 --> 03:10:23,847
Mesthi waé aku percaya karo kowé, Kakang Zhong.

4996
03:10:23,997 --> 03:10:26,389
Klan Qin bersekongkol karo pasukan berkuda Mongol

4997
03:10:26,539 --> 03:10:29,095
lan nyegat kita ing jurang gunung nalika perjalanan bali.

4998
03:10:29,245 --> 03:10:30,485
Apa sing kok omongaké mau?

4999
03:10:30,635 --> 03:10:31,929
Apa sing kadadian satemené?

5000
03:10:32,079 --> 03:10:34,827
Kita disergap dening rong puluh siji tentara bayaran Mongol

5001
03:10:34,977 --> 03:10:36,417
Kita nyekel siji sing isih urip

5002
03:10:36,567 --> 03:10:37,529
Dheweke wis ngaku.

5003
03:10:37,800 --> 03:10:39,432
Dheweke direkrut dening Klan Qin.

5004
03:10:39,600 --> 03:10:40,916
Apa wis padha kelangan akal?

5005
03:10:41,066 --> 03:10:43,586
Yen pancen ana wong sing slamet sing menehi kesaksian...

5006
03:10:43,736 --> 03:10:46,536
Kabupaten Qingshui ora bakal nglaporake menyang prefektur.

5007
03:10:46,686 --> 03:10:48,176
Wong-wong mau bakal nglaporake.

5008
03:10:48,326 --> 03:10:50,520
Nanging sanajan wis lapor menyang pihak berwenang...

5009
03:10:50,670 --> 03:10:52,558
Sedulur Zhong, apa pancen kowé mikir

5010
03:10:52,708 --> 03:10:55,014
apa kita bisa ngalahake Klan Qin liwat panguwasa?

5011
03:10:55,541 --> 03:10:56,013
Angel.

5012
03:10:57,174 --> 03:10:58,096
Yèn ngono kok angel?

5013
03:10:58,774 --> 03:11:01,002
Klan Qin wis nguwasani Qinzhou pirang-pirang taun.

5014
03:11:01,152 --> 03:11:03,972
Kasugihan, koneksi, lan pengaruhe wong-wong mau jero banget.

5015
03:11:04,122 --> 03:11:05,924
Anggere dhèwèké ora mbukak pemberontakan

5016
03:11:06,074 --> 03:11:07,476
mung siji saksi sing isih urip

5017
03:11:07,626 --> 03:11:09,286
ora bakal cukup kanggo ngrubuhke dhèwèké

5018
03:11:09,436 --> 03:11:10,218
Kejaba iku,

5019
03:11:10,570 --> 03:11:13,328
Eyang kakung Qin Sheng isih ana ing sandhinge Kanselir Tong.

5020
03:11:14,136 --> 03:11:16,174
Sanajan dhèwèké nyelidiki nganti pungkasan

5021
03:11:16,324 --> 03:11:18,472
dhèwèké mesthi bakal nyalahke sawetara abdi

5022
03:11:18,622 --> 03:11:20,018
Mbayar ganti rugi luwih sithik.

5023
03:11:20,168 --> 03:11:22,954
Kuwi mbokmenawa cukup kanggo ndhelikake ing sangisoré karpet.

5024
03:11:23,202 --> 03:11:25,014
Dadi aku ora teka mrene dina iki

5025
03:11:25,164 --> 03:11:28,176
njaluk sliramu njunjung keadilan kanggo aku, Sedulur Zhong.

5026
03:11:29,231 --> 03:11:29,843
Keadilan

5027
03:11:30,497 --> 03:11:31,469
Aku bakal njupuk dhèwèké.

5028
03:11:33,531 --> 03:11:34,743
Apa sing arep koklakoni?

5029
03:11:34,964 --> 03:11:35,876
Patènana Qin Heng.

5030
03:11:36,026 --> 03:11:37,242
Mateni Qin Yuanhao.

5031
03:11:37,392 --> 03:11:40,322
Menehi tanggung jawab marang Qin Hongying kanggo ngurus kulawargane.

5032
03:11:40,472 --> 03:11:42,010
Apa kowé arep ngilangké Klan Qin?

5033
03:11:42,372 --> 03:11:45,206
Ngontrol bisnis keluargane malah ngrusak kabèh klan keluargane.

5034
03:11:45,672 --> 03:11:47,180
Aku péngin saben toko Klan Qin

5035
03:11:47,330 --> 03:11:49,670
rute perdagangan, saham, lan dhuwit uga

5036
03:11:51,796 --> 03:11:53,814
Aku ora bakal ngganggu wong wadon-wadon kuwi.

5037
03:11:53,964 --> 03:11:56,878
Aku uga ora bakal mateni sing migunani tanpa pilih kasih.

5038
03:11:57,028 --> 03:11:58,662
Nanging Qin Heng lan Qin Yuanhao

5039
03:11:59,095 --> 03:12:00,017
kudu diurus dhisik.

5040
03:12:03,728 --> 03:12:05,136
Klan Qin dudu kulawarga cilik.

5041
03:12:05,595 --> 03:12:08,179
Kepala Klan lan Tuan Muda loro-lorone mati sewengi

5042
03:12:08,329 --> 03:12:10,395
Kepiye carane pihak berwenang ora nyelidiki?

5043
03:12:10,545 --> 03:12:13,187
Kepriyé carane sampeyan nangani akibat saka bencana kasebut?

5044
03:12:13,337 --> 03:12:15,885
Klan Qin mbayar wong Mongol kanggo nindakake pakaryan reged

5045
03:12:16,035 --> 03:12:17,387
Nanging pakaryane gagal

5046
03:12:17,537 --> 03:12:19,685
Lan dhèwèké kelangan sebagian besar wong lanange

5047
03:12:19,835 --> 03:12:21,705
Wong-wong sing slamet, nesu lan isin

5048
03:12:21,855 --> 03:12:23,897
teka ngetrok njaluk bayaran ing wayah wengi

5049
03:12:24,047 --> 03:12:25,691
mateni para kepala omah tangga

5050
03:12:25,841 --> 03:12:27,433
ngrampok barang-barang berhargane

5051
03:12:27,583 --> 03:12:28,981
banjur ilang ing wayah wengi

5052
03:12:31,150 --> 03:12:32,654
Kowé kudu nyamar dadi wong Mongol.

5053
03:12:32,804 --> 03:12:33,146
Ya

5054
03:12:33,296 --> 03:12:35,716
Anggere pihak berwenang ora nyelidiki kanthi jero,

5055
03:12:35,866 --> 03:12:37,100
penyamaran iki bakal cukup.

5056
03:12:37,566 --> 03:12:39,978
Klan Qin wis nguwasani Qinzhou nganti pirang-pirang taun.

5057
03:12:40,128 --> 03:12:42,526
Kudune wis ana wong sing nurunake dhèwèké wiwit biyen.

5058
03:12:42,676 --> 03:12:43,916
Yen iki tenan berhasil

5059
03:12:44,066 --> 03:12:45,802
Klan Zhong mung perlu nutup kuping

5060
03:12:45,952 --> 03:12:47,520
lan aja dideleng kanthi jero banget

5061
03:12:47,670 --> 03:12:50,714
Kita bisa nganggo kesempatan iki kanggo nyingkirake ancaman kasebut

5062
03:12:54,170 --> 03:12:55,660
Kowé ora ana ing kéné dina iki

5063
03:12:55,810 --> 03:12:57,208
njaluk tulung aku mateni wong.

5064
03:12:57,358 --> 03:12:57,800
Ora.

5065
03:12:58,391 --> 03:12:59,929
Kowé ana ing kéné arep takon aku

5066
03:13:00,079 --> 03:13:01,285
ora kanggo ngalangi kowé.

5067
03:13:01,779 --> 03:13:02,251
Persis.

5068
03:13:03,346 --> 03:13:05,776
Biasane, aku kuduné takon karo pakdheku dhisik.

5069
03:13:05,926 --> 03:13:08,324
Nanging pakdheku budhal menyang sisih lor-kulon wingi.

5070
03:13:08,474 --> 03:13:10,492
Bisa uga butuh sewulan sadurungé dhèwèké bali.

5071
03:13:10,642 --> 03:13:11,594
Sajrone sewulan,

5072
03:13:11,744 --> 03:13:13,442
dhèwèké bisa uga ora bisa bali manèh.

5073
03:13:13,592 --> 03:13:15,644
Gubernur Zhong lunga menyang sisih lor-kulon.

5074
03:13:16,425 --> 03:13:17,613
Menuju Tentara Deshun

5075
03:13:17,792 --> 03:13:19,672
Xia Kulon akhir-akhir iki ora tenang.

5076
03:13:19,822 --> 03:13:21,580
Wates wis ngemobilisasi pasukan.

5077
03:13:21,730 --> 03:13:22,750
Yen perang tenan pecah,

5078
03:13:22,996 --> 03:13:25,494
pemerintah prefektur mbokmenawa ora bakal duwe wektu

5079
03:13:25,644 --> 03:13:28,560
kanggo ngrampungake masalah lawas karo para pedagang ing kutha.

5080
03:13:28,710 --> 03:13:31,242
Koyone kahanane luwih penting tinimbang sing dipikirake.

5081
03:13:31,392 --> 03:13:32,134
Sedulur Lin

5082
03:13:32,284 --> 03:13:34,542
Bengi iki, kowé ora tau ana ing Zhong Manor.

5083
03:13:34,692 --> 03:13:36,148
Matur nuwun, Sedulur Zhong.

5084
03:13:36,298 --> 03:13:39,746
Aja nganti iki dadi ora terkendali nganti pihak berwenang ora bisa nutupi.

5085
03:13:39,896 --> 03:13:41,330
Yen kabèh wong ing kutha ngerti,

5086
03:13:41,480 --> 03:13:43,848
Aku ora bakal bisa pura-pura ora weruh apa-apa.

5087
03:13:43,998 --> 03:13:45,392
Aja kuwatir, Kakang Zhong.

5088
03:13:45,542 --> 03:13:46,722
Wiwit aku wani teka,

5089
03:13:46,872 --> 03:13:49,048
Aku ora bakal ninggalake jejak ing kutha iki.

5090
03:13:49,198 --> 03:13:50,736
Aku mikir pungkasané aku ngerti

5091
03:13:50,886 --> 03:13:51,418
Baduru

5092
03:13:51,720 --> 03:13:53,858
kok dhèwèké tansah kandha nèk kowé dudu wong biasa.

5093
03:13:54,008 --> 03:13:58,172
Panjenengan sampun nindakaken kathah pakaryan kangge kula dinten punika, Kakang Zhong.

5094
03:13:58,322 --> 03:13:59,284
Kita bakal cuti.

5095
03:14:04,922 --> 03:14:06,096
Kepriyé kabare She Tou?

5096
03:14:07,022 --> 03:14:07,884
Ayo mangan dhisik.

5097
03:14:09,955 --> 03:14:11,589
Kita duwe rencana gedhé bengi iki

5098
03:14:11,739 --> 03:14:13,877
Ora bisa nglakoni kuwi nalika weteng kosong

5099
03:14:22,405 --> 03:14:23,795
Mimpin dalan menyang omah Qin.

5100
03:14:29,905 --> 03:14:30,651
Terus pantau

